| CUDA Concept | RAJA Abstraction | How it Changes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `__global__ void kernel(...)` | Standard C++ function (`void kernel(...)`) | The kernel becomes a regular function body. |
| `<<<grid, block>>>` launch | `raja::parallel_for(start, end, lambda)` | The explicit launch configuration is replaced by a high-level loop construct. |
